*~
.DS_Store
# Cargo.lock is COMMITTED (2026-08-09): un-pinned deps let CI float ahead of
# dev machines — dashu-ratio 0.4.4's to_f64 rounding fix silently flipped the
# byte-identical overlay goldens on CI only, part of a 2-month red streak.
# Dep upgrades are deliberate `cargo update -p …` commits gated by the full
# test pyramid, like any other change.

# Claude Code session state (but track the shared project settings)
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json

# Docker
.env

# Test profiling output
test-timings-rust.log
test-timings-gui.json

# Reference documentation (fetched from external sources)
docs/references/

# Reference PDFs (large binaries, not code)
refs/

# GUI test artifacts (Playwright screenshots, failure dirs)
app/screenshots/
app/static/screenshots/
app/test-results/
test-results/
app/tests/*.png

# PropTest regression seeds (generated at runtime)
*.proptest-regressions

# Vim swap files (dot-prefix variants)
.*.swp
.*.swo

# auto-waffle session logs (large, ephemeral)
scripts/auto-waffle/logs/
app/static/assay/
crates/kernel-v2/target/

# Ad-hoc .waffle repro/save scratch files at the repo root (design review F17).
# These are local working documents, not fixtures — keep them out of the tree.
# (Committed test fixtures live under app/tests/ / crates/*/tests/, not root.)
/*.waffle
